  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the chemical reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;the reaction proceeds as follows</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;(Fast)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;(Slow)</p><p>the rate law expression should be given as</p>",
    "image": null
