  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math> be the rate constant of given reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mover><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>From the slowest step <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;...&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>To eliminate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mfenced></math>, (From fast step)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mi>eq</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, substituting value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mfenced></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Eq</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math></p><p>Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
